# RULE: text is checked out with LF on every platform: the page's CSP hashes its inline script, and the build and
#   tests compare text byte for byte. Binary files are left alone.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.pixiwyg binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.sf2 binary
*.wsz binary
*.mid binary
